      "id": "sample-garden",
      "sourceId": "sample-7",
      "title": "[Mẫu] Khu vườn sau thư viện",
      "body": "On Saturday mornings, Minh visits a small garden behind his local library. The garden belongs to the neighborhood, and everyone can help there. Minh usually works with his friend An. They water young plants and collect dry leaves for compost. Last week, a librarian showed them how to make labels from old wooden sticks. Minh wrote the names of herbs on the labels, while An drew small pictures beside the words. Younger children can now find the plants easily. Before going home, the two friends borrow books about nature. Minh wants to grow mint on his balcony, but he will start with just one pot. He thinks a small garden is a good place to learn patience and meet kind neighbors.",
      "wordCount": 121,
      "level": 2
    }
  ],
